# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC (GitHub Pages). Nothing here may leak source data.
# The marketplace database lives outside this folder on purpose and must never
# be committed. Only the approved aggregate JSON in /data/ ships.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Databases — never, under any path.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite

# Raw and intermediate data extracts.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
raw/
scratch/
exports/
backups/

# Internal working documents. These stay on this machine — the repo is public, and
# the build spec and handoff describe the gating strategy and outreach approach.
docs/
CLAUDE.md

# Secrets.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Python.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.venv/

# OS / editor cruft.
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# NOTE: /data/*.json is intentionally NOT ignored — those are the approved,
# reviewed aggregate payloads the page loads. If it's in /data/, it's public.

